{"availability":"available","full":"51nb/miox","name":"miox","description":"Modern infrastructure of complex SPA ","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":365,"forks":28,"created":"2017-09-11T08:16:39Z","updated":"2018-07-31T07:58:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://51nb.github.io/miox-doc","topics":["cache","demo","engine","hybird","lifecycle","middleware","miox","plugin","renderer","router","spa","spa-framework","ssr","web","webpack","webview"],"demo":"https://51nb.github.io/miox-doc","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T17:59:17.133Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T17:59:17.133Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T17:59:17.133Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:08:12.133Z","stars":364,"forks":28},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:01:02.859Z","stars":364,"forks":28},{"at":"2026-10-16T17:59:17.133Z","stars":365,"forks":28}],"technologies":["React","Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["In classic web development, browser creates and manages a series of lifecycle activities of web page, such as session history, page creation, discard, pageshow, pagehide, on which developers can process their own logic.","In an SPA application, developers have to deal with all these events by themselves, or by a framework that deals with them. Miox is yet another framework deals with them.","As of today, almost every web front-end project in 51 credit card is using Miox as there SPA framework, on both PC and mobile sides, which means Miox is already widely used and tested in production."],"features":["What makes Miox special, is that it supports any render core, which means with Miox, developer can simultaneously introduce Miox into their projects and stay with his favorite react or vue.","Miox focuses on being an SPA runtime, with such limited small goal, it developed the ability to easily integrate with most essential technologies, including redux/vuex, SSR and so on."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/51nb/miox/b